==Battleground==
*1 [[Shin Godzilla]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*15 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that anyone can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

